Readers of rgrn, players of NetHack, and anyone else who's interested in
being there are cordially invited to be present at the Lord Moon of the
Mall pub, Whitehall for the regular London meet, with the purpose of
boozing, eating, and conversation about NetHack and affiliated geekery,
on Saturday 29th November, starting from 14:00. I will try to actually
be present this time round :-)

The LMotM is at the top of Whitehall; maybe a hundred yards down, on
the right-hand side as you go down from Trafalgar Square. Nearest tube
Charing Cross, though Westminster isn't that much further away for
those for whom that's quicker to get to. Look for people who are
either outright wearing NetHack T-shirts, or just looking generally
geek-like.

